{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/10/8895912/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅんかなちゃんに\nホールドされる琴子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その写真写る！と言って\n手だけ入ってくるれいかちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを撮る私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平和だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755のさゆりんご軍団の記録ページに\n動画も上げておりますので\nよろしければ(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/10/8895912/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FLASHスペシャル\nまだ見てない方は是非(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんごちゃんベレー帽は\n衣装さんの手作りです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しい作り方はあとで755で\n説明しようかな、どうしようかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていっても簡単に作れるんだけどね(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの愛しの坊ちゃんと\nその弟の愛しの大仏様に\n会いに行ってきたよ～～(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/10/8895912/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい子は私の癒し(   ´ω`   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でも子連れで来てくれる方\nいらっしゃるんだけど、\nずっとお話ししていたくて、\n私が剥がされることが多々。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月もう一回会えるかもしれないから\n私はその日を楽しみに\n毎日生きるんだ～～(^o^)♡♡♡(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/10/8895912/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎乃木坂工事中の『ITO』やばかった⁽⁽ ◟(∗ ˊωˋ ∗)◞ ⁾⁾らぶ♡（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→気づいてくれてる人いたー！\nめっちゃ通り過ぎるの早くて\n誰にも気づかれないと思った！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんのこっちゃ分からない方は\n乃木坂工事中のオープニング\n見直してみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、月刊エンタメさんの\n取材があったんだけど、\n取材後もライターの大貫さんと\n乃木坂の話やらアイドルの話で\n盛り上がったのね。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこでふと思ったけど、\nいろんなライターさん達と\n座談会がしたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂について、アイドル論について！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/10/8895912/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}